	"Name": "Kenneth's Bakery",
	"Author": "Kf29",
	"Description": "[b]Adds a new constructible building - Kenneth's Bakery (built by Robin) - with 18 custom bakery foods to buy, each with its own cooking recipe and buffs![/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]Customization: By default, all bakery foods appear in the shop. If you prefer a smaller menu and have Generic Mod Config Menu (GMCM) installed, you can disable individual bakery foods to remove them from the shop along with their cooking recipes. Re-enabling a bakery food restores it to the shop and its recipe to your kitchen.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]More details can be found in ReadMe.txt.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[b]Please do not reupload this mod or include it in modpacks without permission.[/b]",
